@startuml
title 适老化打车平台 - 多支付方式完整链路时序图 (Payment Flow Sequence)

actor "老年用户" as User
participant "APP前端\n(React Native)" as App
participant "支付服务\n(PaymentService)" as PaySvc
participant "后端API\n(Backend API)" as API
participant "支付网关\n(WeChat/Alipay)" as PGW
participant "SMS网关" as SMS
participant "司机端" as Driver
participant "亲友端" as Family

== 1. 行程结束，展示账单 ==
Driver -> API: 结束行程
activate API
API -> API: 计算费用\n(里程+时长+动态调价)
API -> API: 生成账单记录\n(payments表)
API --> App: 推送账单信息\n{orderId, amount, tripSummary}
deactivate API

activate App
App -> App: 大字展示账单\n"起点: 幸福小区\n终点: 人民医院\n费用: ¥25.00"
App --> User: 选择支付方式\n[自己支付] [现金支付] [亲友代付]
deactivate App

== 2A. 线上支付（自己支付） ==
User -> App: 点击"自己支付"
activate App
App -> PaySvc: selfPay(orderId)
activate PaySvc
PaySvc -> API: POST /api/v1/payments/{orderId}/pay\n{method: "online"}
activate API
API -> PGW: 发起支付请求
activate PGW
PGW -> PGW: 处理支付
PGW --> API: 支付成功
deactivate PGW
API -> API: 更新支付状态为"paid"
API --> PaySvc: 支付成功\n{receipt}
deactivate API

PaySvc --> App: 返回支付凭证
deactivate PaySvc
App -> App: 大字展示支付结果\n"支付成功 ✓\n¥25.00"
App -> App: TTS播报"支付成功"
App --> User: 支付完成
deactivate App
stop

== 2B. 现金支付 ==
User -> App: 点击"现金支付"
activate App
App -> PaySvc: cashPay(orderId)
activate PaySvc
PaySvc -> API: POST /api/v1/payments/{orderId}/pay\n{method: "cash"}
activate API
API -> API: 创建现金支付记录\n(status: "pending")
API --> PaySvc: 等待司机确认
deactivate API
PaySvc --> App: {status: "pending"}
deactivate PaySvc

App -> App: 大字提示\n"请向司机支付现金 ¥25.00"
App --> User: "请向司机支付现金"

User -> Driver: 支付现金
Driver -> API: 确认收到现金
activate API
API -> API: 更新支付状态为"paid"
API --> App: 现金支付完成
deactivate API

App -> App: 大字展示支付结果\n"现金支付完成 ✓"
App -> App: TTS播报"支付完成"
App --> User: 支付完成
deactivate App

== 2C. 亲友代付 ==
User -> App: 点击"亲友代付"
activate App
App -> PaySvc: familyPay(orderId, {name, phone})
activate PaySvc
PaySvc -> API: POST /api/v1/payments/{orderId}/pay\n{method: "family", familyContact: {name, phone}}
activate API
API -> API: 生成支付链接\n(24小时有效期)
API -> SMS: 发送支付短信
activate SMS
SMS -> Family: 【打车代付】\n幸福小区→人民医院\n费用 ¥25.00\n点击链接支付
deactivate SMS

API --> PaySvc: 支付链接已发送
deactivate API
PaySvc --> App: {status: "pending", payLinkSent: true}
deactivate PaySvc

App -> App: 大字提示\n"已发送代付请求给小王"
App --> User: "等待家人支付..."

== 3. 亲友端支付 ==
Family -> Family: 打开支付链接
activate Family
Family -> Family: 查看行程详情\n(起终点+金额+时长+司机)
Family -> Family: 点击"确认代付"
Family -> API: 确认支付
activate API
API -> PGW: 处理支付
activate PGW
PGW --> API: 支付成功
deactivate PGW
API -> API: 更新支付状态为"paid"
API --> Family: 支付成功
deactivate Family
API --> App: 推送"支付已完成"
deactivate API

App -> App: 大字展示支付结果\n"小王已帮您支付 ¥25.00 ✓"
App -> App: TTS播报"家人已帮您支付"
App --> User: 支付完成
deactivate App
stop

== 4. 支付异常处理 ==
note over PaySvc, API: 支付超时/网络异常处理

alt 支付链接过期(24小时)
  API -> App: 推送"支付链接已过期"
  App --> User: "支付链接已过期，请重新发送"
  User -> App: 点击"重新发送"
  App -> PaySvc: sendPayLink(orderId, phone)
  PaySvc -> API: POST /api/v1/payments/{orderId}/resend-link
  API -> SMS: 重新发送支付链接
end

alt 线上支付超时
  PaySvc -> PaySvc: 轮询支付结果\n(每3秒, 最多30秒)
  loop 轮询(最多10次)
    PaySvc -> API: GET /api/v1/payments/{orderId}/status
    API --> PaySvc: {status: "pending" | "paid" | "expired"}
  end
  alt 30秒仍未确认
    App --> User: "支付结果确认中\n可手动查询"
    App -> App: 显示"查询支付结果"按钮
  end
end

alt 现金支付超时未确认(30分钟)
  API -> App: 推送"现金支付未确认"
  API -> API: 自动转为线上支付
  App --> User: "现金支付未确认\n已转为线上支付"
end

@enduml